{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05ED20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"来这里之前，你一直住在巴黎吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。巴黎是我最喜欢的城市。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"最前沿的时尚、世界最棒的美食，还有汇聚着拥有出色感性的人们——文化与艺术之都。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"夜晚的香榭丽舍大街美得简直不像现实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“香榭丽舍”指的是希腊神话中的<R=乐园,ELYSIUM>，也就是<R=天国,HEAVEN>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=乐园,ELYSIUM>\", \"<R=天国,HEAVEN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"听起来和我没什么缘分。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"你对有文化的生活没兴趣吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"只是一直没那个缘分。我也从没产生过兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"你喜欢战争吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不是。不过，天国之外——Outer Heaven，反而更合我的性子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"真是种艰苦的活法……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……不过，如果以后有机会来法国，我可以带你逛逛巴黎。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"让你看看这个世界上的天国——Heaven。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}